        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nTHREE BEDROOM / THREE BATHROOM HOUSE RATHLYON GROVE, KNOCKLYON, DUBLIN 24 AVAILABLE NOW\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom house to the rental market in the highly sought-after Rathlyon Grove development, Knocklyon, Dublin 24.\nThis bright and spacious home offers excellent living accommodation throughout and is ideally situated in a mature and well-established residential area. Rathlyon Grove is conveniently located close to a host of local amenities including shops, schools, parks, cafés and restaurants. The property also benefits from excellent transport links and easy access to the M50 motorway, making it ideal for commuters.\nInternal accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a spacious living room, a fully fitted kitchen and dining area, three generously sized bedrooms and three bathrooms. The property also benefits from a private rear garden and off-street parking.\nAVAILABLE NOW and viewing is highly advised.\nFeatures:\n<ul>\n <li>3 bedroom / 3 bathroom house</li>\n <li>Bright and spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Presented in excellent condition throughout</li>\n <li>Fully fitted kitchen with dining area</li>\n <li>Three generously sized bedrooms</li>\n <li>Three bathrooms</li>\n <li>Private rear garden</li>\n <li>Off-street parking</li>\n <li>Located in Rathlyon Grove, Knocklyon</li>\n <li>Highly sought-after residential location</li>\n <li>Close to a host of local amenities</li>\n <li>Excellent public transport links</li>\n <li>Easy access to M50 motorway</li>\n <li>Close to local schools and parks</li>\n <li>AVAILABLE NOW!!</li>\n</ul>\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
      },
